  "name": "Chicken Kebabs",
  "subtitle": "Yogurt-marinated chicken with peppers and onion",
  "description": "Tender spiced chicken and vegetables are grilled until cooked through, then served in warm flatbreads with lettuce, yogurt, chili sauce, and lemon.",
